# Session expiry

Quotex **will** expire SSID/cookies. We cannot keep one token forever. Recover by Chrome auto-refresh (`QX_AUTO_REFRESH` + `.chrome-capture` profile that stays **logged in**). Do not switch to email/password login unless they provide credentials and accept Cloudflare/OTP failures on a VPS.
